    <div class="section-container" id="brain-enter">
      <div class="section-titlebar">
        <span class="sect-num">03/</span>
        <h2 class="sect-title">BRAIN.SYS &amp; DNA.SYS</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="dual-columns">
        <RetroWindow title="LEFT_BRAIN.EXE // SYSTEMS" type="exe" class="brain-card left">
          <div class="brain-icon-top">
            <PixelIcons name="dna" size={24} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="brain-role-title">ANALYTICAL RIGOR</h3>
          <p class="brain-body">
            Sebagai mahasiswa <strong>Sistem Informasi</strong>, pendekatan saya dibangun di atas fondasi:
          </p>
          <ul class="brain-list">
            <li>Normalisasi Database 3NF &amp; Partitioning</li>
            <li>Arsitektur Terdistribusi &amp; High-Throughput</li>
            <li>Integritas Relasi, ACID, &amp; Query Optimizing</li>
            <li>Pemetaan Business Process &amp; System Flowchart</li>
          </ul>
        </RetroWindow>

        <RetroWindow title="RIGHT_BRAIN.EXE // CREATIVE" type="alert" class="brain-card right">
          <div class="brain-icon-top">
            <PixelIcons name="brain" size={24} />
          </div>
          <h3 class="brain-role-title">CREATIVE CODE CRAFT</h3>
          <p class="brain-body">
            Sebagai <strong>Creative Web Developer</strong>, saya mengubah kode teknis menjadi dunia seni:
          </p>
          <ul class="brain-list">
            <li>Scroll-Driven Storytelling dengan GSAP</li>
            <li>Desain Retro-Pixel 8-Bit tanpa broken images</li>
            <li>Micro-Interactions, Canvas Mini-Games, Sound UI</li>
            <li>Dual-Mode themes yang ekspresif &amp; responsif</li>
